  "goodToKnow": "Die Titelverteidigung is a title defence in sport: die Titelverteidigung gelingt or scheitert. Der Titelverteidiger is the defending champion. Germany's football team, world champions in 2014, failed spectacularly in their Titelverteidigung at the 2018 World Cup, going out in the group stage for the first time. Verteidigen means to defend. Plural: die Titelverteidigungen."
